WEBVTT

00:05:29.348 --> 00:05:32.079
from the inside out.

00:05:32.079 --> 00:05:34.017
And what we found

00:05:34.017 --> 00:05:36.468
was that Linda's disease didn't look like

00:05:36.468 --> 00:05:39.538
the typical male disease.

00:05:39.538 --> 00:05:42.734
The typical male disease looks like this.

00:05:42.734 --> 00:05:46.046
There's a discrete blockage or stenosis.

00:05:46.046 --> 00:05:50.347
Linda's disease, like the disease of so many women,

00:05:50.347 --> 00:05:52.189
looks like this.

00:05:52.189 --> 00:05:55.726
The plaque is laid down more evenly, more diffusely

00:05:55.726 --> 00:05:59.698
along the artery, and it's harder to see.

00:05:59.698 --> 00:06:03.104
So for Linda, and for so many women,